 ## Scope
 
### In-Scope Features
 
| Feature | Includes |
| --- | --- |
| User Accounts | Sign up and login |
| Match Discovery | View available matches |
| Match Filters | Filter by sport, date and location |
| Match Details | Show date, time, location, number of players and available spots |
| Join Match | Users can join or leave available matches |
| Create Match | Users can create a match and invite other players |
| Match Management | Match creator can view players, edit details and cancel the match |
| Cost Splitting | Cost splitting + payment calculation + payment status tracking + payment simulation |
 
### Out-of-Scope Features
 
| Feature | Includes |
| --- | --- |
| Challenges | Creating public challenges for users to join |
| In-App Chat | Direct messaging between players |
| Advanced Recommendations | Personalized or AI-based match recommendations |
| Ranking and Points | Leaderboards, levels or reward points |
| Advanced Social Features | Followers, social feed or advanced profiles |
| Real Payment Processing | Real payment gateway integration, such as Mada or Apple Pay |
 
